    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\nSherry FitzGerald Brady O'Flaherty are delighted to present 5 Ryebridge Row to the market. This tastefully presented, well-appointed 4-bedroom semi-detached home, extends to an impressive approx. 123 sqm (1,323 sq.ft) The entire accommodation features contemporary design and a well thought out layout ideal for modern family living. No.5 is ideally positioned at the front of the development in a choice cul de sac setting overlooking the Summerhill Road. \nAccommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hall with guest wc, open plan 'L' shaped kitchen/dining room, utility room and large beautifully appointed living room. Upstairs are four fine sized bedrooms (1 en-suite), all with fitted wardrobes and a family bathroom also. Another noteworthy feature is the large convertible attic space. Lovely private, lawned rear garden with paved patio and off-street parking to front.\nRyebridge has become one of the most popular residential developments in Kilcock, now boasting a lovely riverside pedestrian walkway linking the development to the town centre. Set on the western side of Kilcock, just off the Summerhill Road and easily accessible to the M4. Dublin City Centre is within comfortable commuting distance while the vibrant university town of Maynooth is less than 10 minutes' drive. Kilcock Rail Station, Royal Canal Greenway, Schools, Shops etc are all within easy walking distance. \nThis is a wonderful opportunity to acquire a fantastic turn-key, energy efficient family home, in this most sought-after location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.99m x 2.62m\nWith oak herringbone flooring and guest WC off same.\n\nGuest WC - \n\n\nLiving Room - 5.75m x 3.66m\nWith oak herringbone flooring, attractive feature fireplace and bespoke shelving and cabintry.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 7.03m x 5.80m\nL shaped With oak herringbone flooring,contemporary fitted kitchen with ample units,spacious dining area and french doors leading to the rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 1.84m x 1.47m\nPlumbed for washing machine.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.00m x 3.12m\nLarge contemporary main bedroom with carpeted flooring. En-Suite with shower enclosure, WC & WHB.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.81m x 1.97m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.98m x 2.84m\nWith fitted wardrobes and carpeted flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.75m x 2.85m\nWith fitted wardrobes and carpeted flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.60m x 2.58m\nWith fitted wardrobes and carpeted flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.96m x 1.77m\nWith full bathroom suite, tiled bath, wall and floor area.\n\nOutside - \nPrivate parking to the front. Gated side enterance. garden with patio and garden shed.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Energy Efficient home Ideal first time purchase </li><li> Close to all amenities & easily accessible o M4</li><li> GFCH</li><li> Immaculately well-presented throughout </li><li> Lovely private rear garden </li><li> Carpets, curtains, blinds light fitting & electrical appliances included in sale</li><li>Built 2015</ul>"
      },
